 "intro_zh": "西樵山是广东四大名山之一，是中国国家森林公园、中国国家地质公园、国家重点风景名胜区。西樵山自然风光旖旎，山上七十二峰峰峰皆奇，四十二洞洞洞皆幽，更有湖、瀑、泉、涧、岩、壁、潭、台点缀其间。",
 "intro_en": "Xiqiao Mountain is one of the four famous mountains in Guangdong. It is a China National Forest Park, a China National Geopark, and a national key scenic spot. Xiqiao Mountain has beautiful natural scenery. The 72 peaks on the mountain are all strange, and the 42 caves are secluded. There are also lakes, waterfalls, springs, streams, rocks, walls, pools and platforms dotted there.",
